
§ `Seatbelt`
    GIVEN reversing IS A FUNCTION FROM Car TO BOOLEAN
          `is driving` IS A FUNCTION FROM Person AND Car TO BOOLEAN
          `is a police officer` IS A FUNCTION FROM Person TO BOOLEAN

DECLARE Person
DECLARE Car

GIVEN p      IS A Person
      car    IS A Car
safetyRule42 MEANS
  PARTY   p
  MUST    `wear a seatbelt`
  PROVIDED `is driving` p car
           AND NOT     reversing car
                    OR `is a police officer` p
  THE ENTIRE TIME
